message: "If you use this software or the construction, validation, and diffusion-limit materials, please cite this repository and the associated manuscript when appropriate."
title: "Hill Enigma Substitution-Permutation Network (HESPN): Reference Implementation, Validation, and Diffusion-Limit Materials"
type: software
authors:
